# A download in the list that hovering the Library button opens looked the same under the pointer and
# pressed as at rest, so it didn't look like something to pick (GitHub #896). Under the pointer the row
# gets the space's hover fill, pressed the selected tab's, and the list closing lights none.
# promise: #896
home
budget rss=600 stalls50=5
cra://open?url=file://${FIXTURES}/Pages/downloads.html
expect-log loaded file:
cra://debug?cdp=Input.dispatchMouseEvent&params={"type":"mousePressed","x":36,"y":56,"button":"left","clickCount":1}
cra://debug?cdp=Input.dispatchMouseEvent&params={"type":"mouseReleased","x":36,"y":56,"button":"left","clickCount":1}
expect-log Download finished from a data: address
cra://debug?downloads=1
wait 1
cra://debug?downloadsTray=rest&row=leave
expect-log downloads tray rest: open=true .* row=none
cra://debug?downloadsTray=hover&row=hover
expect-log downloads tray hover: open=true .* row=hover
cra://debug?downloadsTray=press&row=press
expect-log downloads tray press: open=true .* row=pressed
cra://debug?downloadsTray=release&row=release
expect-log downloads tray release: open=true .* row=hover
cra://debug?downloads=0
wait 1
cra://debug?downloadsTray=closed&row=hover
expect-log downloads tray closed: open=false .* row=none
